Het MP-het
"Heterogeneous message-passing: P0 on the CPU (AArch64), P1 on the GPU (LISA)"
{
0:X1=x;
0:X3=y;
}
 P0:cpu      | P1:gpu              ;
 MOV W0,#1   | r[acquire,sys] r0 y ;
 STR W0,[X1] | r[relaxed,sys] r1 x ;
 MOV W2,#1   |                     ;
 STR W2,[X3] |                     ;
scopes: (sys (gpu (cta P1)))
exists (1:r0=1 /\ 1:r1=0)
